    },
    {
      "id": "P2",
      "text": "Date of service: November 9, 2026"
    },
    {
      "id": "P3",
      "text": "Endoscopist: Mei-Lin Castellanos, MD (fictional)"
    },
    {
      "id": "P4",
      "text": "History: Right hemicolectomy in 2021; the cecum and ascending colon were removed."
    },
    {
      "id": "P5",
      "text": "Procedure: The colonoscope was advanced to the ileocolic anastomosis, which was narrowed, and the colonoscope could not pass it."
    },
    {
      "id": "P6",
      "text": "A guidewire was advanced through the narrowing into the neo-terminal ileum, and a through-the-scope balloon dilated the anastomosis to 13.5 mm."
    },
    {
      "id": "P7",
      "text": "After the dilation the colonoscope still could not pass the anastomosis, and the examination ended there."
    },
    {
      "id": "P8",
      "text": "Impression: Ileocolic anastomotic stricture dilated to 13.5 mm; the scope did not pass beyond the anastomosis."
    }
  ],
